    {
      "name": "Unnerving Hiss",
      "actions": 1,
      "traits": [
        "auditory",
        "mental"
      ],
      "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per round</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> Hiss beetles aren't bioluminescent like a typical flash beetle, and thus lack that creature's Luminescent Aura and Light Flash abilities. Instead, a hiss beetle can rasp its wide, stumpy legs together to create an unsettling hissing sound. Any creature other than a hiss beetle within a 20ft Type:emanation must attempt a DC 13 Will Saving Throw save or become Frightened 1 (or Frightened 2 on a critical failure). Creatures are then temporarily immune to Unnerving Hiss for 24 hours.</p>",
